### 2026-08-13T23:51:50.877Z | claude (claude-sonnet-5) | claude | conversation 627637ca-d250-4ad7-8a24-ddd841e171dd

Two options, depending on what you need:

- **Just play the game**: open `index.html` directly in a browser (`file://` URL) — no server required, per the README.
- **For anything server-based** (e.g. testing the service worker, or matching what Playwright uses): run
  ```
  npx http-server -p 8001 -c-1
  ```
  then visit `http://localhost:8001`. This is the exact command `[REDACTED_SECRET]` spins up automatically when you run `npm test`.


